        <mxCell id="c249" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Families, with the slicer saved on Time-driven and the page filtered to fiscal 2026 and to items with a family. Drawn here in a different arrangement: the totals table is below the matrix in place of beside it. The slicer filters the cards and the bar chart only (Edit interactions set to None on the matrix and the totals table), so those two show every view at once; outlined in teal: the Time-driven columns and row, which the cards and the chart follow. The matrix has the manufactured items only; the other items are in the totals and the chart. The chart shows the 20 items of the 207 with the largest margin, and scrolls.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="754" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
